WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_00h.avi - Space aftermath of Lunar Cry
Duration: approximately 13 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:13.000
The camera slowly pans across the vast emptiness of space. Debris from the destroyed Lunar Base drifts silently through the void — jagged fragments of metal and structure tumbling in different directions. The massive planet dominates the lower portion of the view, its surface scarred by a deep red crater or gash, the visible wound from the Lunar Cry's catastrophic impact. The moon looms in the middle distance, its surface now barren and dark, stripped clean of the monstrous creatures that once covered it entirely. Stars glitter distantly against the infinite black. The scene is silent, desolate, and haunting — a testament to the devastation wrought by the Lunar Cry.
